	(text "PL1 Interface\n40-pin ribbon to base board PL1 (stays). Pinout from manual sockets - UNVERIFIED (Signal_list V1).\nL+ = +24V, L- = GND (L- is tied to PE on PL1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "43d9c69e-cdc9-4c8e-8191-533ab5937947")
	)
	(text "Not used (no-connect):\n5/6 = 22 V~ (old 3N1 supply, hour counter P4 if fitted)\n38/39 = 9.5 V DC (old display P2)\nOthers: not in the manual - measure (Signal_list V5)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "dac29b50-8781-46ec-8497-5d182ae81dcb")
	)
	(text_box "TO DESIGN\n- Pinout is derived from the manual - verify on the unit before ordering anything (Signal_list V1-V6).\n- J1 must mate with the existing ribbon from PL1: check pitch, keying (box header with polarisation notch) and orientation of pin 1.\n- Test points on TE_L+, T_L+, +24V, GND for commissioning.\n- No electronics on this sheet: protection (PTC, TVS) sits in the blocks that own the signal.\n\nCOMPONENT PROPOSAL\n- J1: 2x20 box header 2.54 mm, vertical, e.g. Wurth WR-BHD series (match the original cable; latching ejector version if the old header had one)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 40.64 0)
		(size 190.5 22.6)
		(margins 1.0287 1.0287 1.0287 1.0287)
		(stroke
